:: m0 default
-> m2

:: m1
> speaker=s1 bind=(count:int=$count) @l0
  Count {count}, Rain hello.
> bind=(count:int=$count) @l1
  Count {count}, Quiet wait.
> @l2
  Hello tomorrow.
-> m2

:: m2
> speaker=s0 @l3
  Onward wait.
? requires=(flag(rhea) and flag(player) and ready()) @c4
  Quiet quiet.
  -> m0
? requires=(ready()) @c5
  Hello quiet.
  -> m0
